Trust: 1 exact. 3: grid is coarse in s (step 1) but the refinement from the four best separated cells all ended at the
same point; fairly sure (a second basin is not excluded). 2: local searches on a rough landscape; (a) and (b) are upper
bounds on the true least, the raw starts scattered by a factor 1.5, so I would not be surprised by a load 10-20% lower.
40 rings and the cap of 400 are my choices; finer rings were not tried blind.
